    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Run, Swim, Jump, Extinguish and Push!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/7e3980e458ed4bc15c17046fb280b0a7.poster.avif?t=1755115106\" width=616 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/7e3980e458ed4bc15c17046fb280b0a7.webm?t=1755115106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/7e3980e458ed4bc15c17046fb280b0a7.mp4?t=1755115106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into the thrilling action of FireHero, a pixel art game where you play as a courageous firefighter, determined to rescue civilians trapped in burning buildings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/03961c0778f7fb9fae5173f5cf735c38.avif?t=1755115106\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage and wield the tools at your disposal to overcome raging flames and reach the victims (including adorable cats!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/396c74d909e1b4a4b2cd427e1088bcb4.poster.avif?t=1755115106\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/396c74d909e1b4a4b2cd427e1088bcb4.webm?t=1755115106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/396c74d909e1b4a4b2cd427e1088bcb4.mp4?t=1755115106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26f0\ufe0f Varied Biomes and Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse <strong>biomes</strong>, each with its own unique art style, ambiance, and gameplay challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Object Manipulation and Use</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>crates</strong> to navigate levels, from floating wooden crates for crossing water to heavy iron crates for solving underwater puzzles. Equip various tools, such as fire <strong>extinguishers</strong> and axes, to tackle fires and obstacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a Water Level Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust <strong>water</strong> levels to access hard-to-reach platforms. Flood areas to extinguish fires or create water pathways to navigate through levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Coin Collection / Star completion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>coins</strong> scattered throughout levels to unlock stars. Each star plays a role in your mission to save civilians and progress in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Hidden Bonus Cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and rescue hidden cats in every level to earn special stars. These felines friends  add an extra challenge for the most dedicated players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Graphics:</strong> Enjoy a retro visual style that blends classic charm with a vibrant, modern aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> A unique combination of water management and object manipulation creates an engaging and varied experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> With coins to collect, stars to unlock, and hidden cats to save, there\u2019s always a reason to explore and replay levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Are you ready to brave the flames and become a hero?</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
