n cats to save, there\u2019s always a reason to explore and replay levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Are you ready to brave the flames and become a hero?</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
